Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.77,0:00:06.97,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,You wanted to show us what a \Nboss fight looks like, first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:10.34,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's part of it. But not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:13.82,Main,Adventurer,0,0,0,,My leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:19.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even if you lose, you won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:22.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:26.00,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's no shame for an adventurer \Nin avoiding a fight you can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:29.22,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:32.17,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,But no, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:37.13,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,If I run away here, I don't \Nthink I'll ever come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:40.96,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I'll never be a real adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:42.90,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Ryze...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.70,0:00:45.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You've made your decision, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:25.79,Title,Rentt,0,0,0,,{\an1\shad0\bord2\fs17\fade(1000,400)\c&H908A88&\3c&H000000&\b1\pos(207.121,279.502)} Magical\NContract
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:46.22,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,A Grand Slime...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:51.71,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,We won't mess up like those guys did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:54.89,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Let's be the ones to tell \Nthe guild we beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.47,0:02:57.37,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,This didn't go like I was hoping.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:03:00.96,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,There's no actual need to \Nbeat the boss for this exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:07.10,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was hoping those other \Nexaminees would beat it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:12.41,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But, well, it's important to \Nencounter some challenges in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.68,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I can see through your attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:20.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Aim for its core!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:32.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Focus on empowering your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:39.29,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,These two are capable of \Ndefeating a Grand Slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:44.07,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Listen to me. Physical attacks \Nwill barely work at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:47.30,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Magic's what you'll need to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:50.37,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Can you use powerful fire magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:52.39,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,Yes, a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:55.79,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,But it'll take time to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:57.29,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:03:59.87,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll block its attacks while you're casting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.87,0:04:03.79,Flashback,Ryze,0,0,0,,Wait. Can you let me be the one to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:12.81,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Rentt, help Ryze! I'm fine on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:26.40,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.28,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Grand Pyrox!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:50.95,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,We got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:52.74,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Finish it before it regenerates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:53.68,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:02.82,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:05.28,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Yeah. We beat the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:09.13,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:12.75,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Slime fluids are worth a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:13.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Let's gather them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:18.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Even if we split the money among the three \Nof us, we'll get at least one silver each.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.52,0:05:25.63,Main,Adventurers,0,0,0,,See you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:27.86,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:31.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I knew you'd figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.81,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Just like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:41.28,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,A sleeping gas trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:44.94,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Right before the goal is one of the \Nplaces people let their guard down most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:49.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Not that it really matters if \Nthey get there ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:51.53,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:56.97,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Getting there first doesn't \Nmean passing, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:59.40,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Think back really carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:02.53,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,The guild didn't say a word about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:07.13,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Your job is to reach the \Npoint written on your map.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.41,0:06:13.10,Flashback,Man,0,0,0,,The first party to arrive will receive \Na reward befitting their efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.03,0:06:19.84,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,They set it up so we'd think \Nit was a race, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:23.38,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,That's why Rentt didn't mind \Nletting the other party go ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.98,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,even when we were in front of the boss room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:27.96,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,That's a mean trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:29.66,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I feel stupid for worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:36.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,An adventurer's only job is to complete \Nthe task before the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.15,0:06:40.01,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,It wouldn't have killed \Nthem to tell us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:45.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You can't be a real adventurer \Nunless you can think for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.69,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.69,0:06:52.80,Main,Man,0,0,0,,You're the first here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:54.66,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Are you real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:57.39,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Show us proof you're with the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.82,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Is this enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:03.26,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:07.06,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Take these, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:13.51,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Show these to the guild's front desk and \Nyou'll become Bronze-class adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:19.95,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that bonus that \Nyou guys talked about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.95,0:07:24.33,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Oh, the first three teams \Nget a little bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.33,0:07:27.54,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Here. Potions and a case for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.49,0:07:30.45,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I've been wanting one of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:34.05,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,So that's what that was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:35.65,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:41.19,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Can we make a side trip before we go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:48.32,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,This is the 2nd floor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:50.82,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Do you know what it's like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:51.73,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:56.44,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The labyrinths are beyond \Nhuman understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:58.75,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You'll realize that up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:11.81,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Why is there a sun underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:16.74,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'd heard that each floor was \Ntotally different, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:18.09,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:21.67,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This is the world you're about to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:23.53,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:30.20,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.32,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Let's take a little look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:33.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.66,0:08:35.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The exam's not over until we're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:46.52,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It feels like it's been so long \Nsince I've seen this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:49.76,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,There were traps on the way home \Ntoo, just like we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:53.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Remember what I said? The guild...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.07,Main,Both,0,0,0,,...can be mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:57.78,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Okay, good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:03.38,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,With this, the Bronze-class examination \Ncomes to an end for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:07.48,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Does this mean we're Bronze-class now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.74,0:09:09.10,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:11.74,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,Sister, they'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:13.52,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,Here's the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:17.03,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:18.38,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:19.81,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:24.32,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,He was watching us the whole \Ntime during the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:27.65,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I had no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:31.49,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,The exam also tests what \Nkind of person you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.49,0:09:36.87,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,We can't raise your rank if we decide you're \Nnot the right kind of person for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.87,0:09:39.36,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,And so we...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:42.05,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You pass without problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.91,0:09:45.89,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Now you're real Bronze-class adventurers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.02,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,We passed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:51.60,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Laura? \NShe says we passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:53.57,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,We did it, Ryze!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:55.37,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we left the village!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:59.79,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yeah! It was worth coming even when \NMom and Dad didn't want me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:02.63,Main - Top,Sheila,0,0,0,,What they're saying kind of scares me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:03.89,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.46,Main - Top,Brother,0,0,0,,Well, it happens a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:06.47,Main - Top,Ryze,0,0,0,,We need to go tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:07.99,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,So I'm Bronze-class again now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:14.08,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Ryze, Laura. Thanks for \Ncoming with me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:16.44,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,No, that's our line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:18.62,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,We won't forget what you taught us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.09,0:10:26.03,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Rentt, thanks to you, I think we've \Nfinally become real adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.51,0:10:27.90,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Ryze...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:31.70,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you to keep \Nadventuring with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:34.27,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,but that's impossible, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:41.95,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,It feels like your goal is \Nsomehow different than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:45.49,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,That's why you told us all that \Nstuff during the exam, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:48.80,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,So we could make it on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:49.78,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.78,0:10:52.48,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,You may have only been a part \Nof our party for one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:54.75,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,but you're still a treasured comrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:57.26,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's adventure again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.28,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,They're good kids, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:08.94,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yeah. I felt like a parent \Nmore than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:12.07,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But they might've been working hard \Nto make me feel welcome, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:17.02,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:21.62,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:26.05,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I apologize for asking when you're \Ntired, but will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:31.65,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You're sharp enough to know \Nwhat I want to ask, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:36.98,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sheila knows who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:42.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Does the Guild intend to punish \Nme for what I've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:45.28,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I'm asking the questions here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:51.74,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I'll never \Ncome back to this guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:52.84,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:53.98,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:58.94,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I just want to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:04.51,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,What exactly happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:10.36,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I thought about running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:13.01,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:19.96,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Her voice was the voice of a woman who was \Ngenuinely worried about an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.96,0:12:27.59,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sheila, I've got a big problem \NI'm dealing with right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:33.43,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone getting \Ninvolved. Not even the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:39.64,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt, I actually haven't told \Nthe guild about you, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:45.65,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sheila... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:49.36,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Part of it was that I wasn't sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:53.57,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But more than anything, I wanted \Nto see the truth for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:13:01.96,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I've told the man who was watching \Nyou during the exam a little, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.96,0:13:04.23,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:06.89,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,He can keep a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.05,0:13:12.50,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Would you please tell me \Nwhat's happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.47,0:13:17.34,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,It's hard to trust me, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.77,0:13:20.80,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,So I've prepared this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A magical contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:24.27,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:27.60,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,If the contract detailed here is broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:30.72,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,in this case, if I share your secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:34.78,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I'll suffer a penalty \Nbacked by magical force.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:37.26,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,If she does not carry out \Nher end of the contract,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.26,0:13:43.93,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Sheila Ibarss will leave the guild, travel \Nto a country where slavery is legal,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:47.37,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,and perform the necessary paperwork to \Ntransfer ownership of herself to another party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.85,0:13:50.85,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, no, no. That's way too heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:57.73,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Why go that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:05.45,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I want to help you, and not \Nbecause I'm part of the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:06.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:13.12,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Because it's thanks to you that I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:14.91,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sheila...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:21.34,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You don't realize it, but there are a \Nlot of people who are grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:25.93,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,All right. I'll sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.10,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,And then I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:29.53,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:36.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now, where to begin...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.58,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It would be faster to show you, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:49.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Terrifying, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:53.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I bet you regret asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:55.38,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,No! That's not true...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:58.22,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,It's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:05.37,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,If you're suffering that much...\NI'd much rather know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:09.16,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But how did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:11.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've turned into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:18.05,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm an undead right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.07,0:15:21.18,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:28.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can see why you'd feel \Ndistressed hearing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.46,0:15:33.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,So I want you to think about \Nit again before you answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:37.84,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Can you really help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:44.36,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Of course, I have no intention \Nof harming anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:48.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But that's a different question from \Nwhether you can believe me or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.29,0:15:50.29,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:53.73,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:58.27,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I believe you're a monster now, \Nand that you won't attack anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:05.86,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Because... Because... you \Nwere always such a good guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:09.66,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Those kids... and me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.41,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,We all owe you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:14.94,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,So I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:21.75,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt, if something happens between \Nyou and the guild, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:25.42,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I promise... I promise I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.91,0:16:34.17,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:36.60,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for coming at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:41.93,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I insisted on coming to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:45.73,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, you're certainly a rare guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:48.89,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, don't tell me you've \Nbeen messing around with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.89,0:16:50.91,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,He hasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:52.90,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But I've learned a lot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:54.62,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:55.87,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:58.18,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:00.32,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's not very clean, though, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:04.77,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I cleaned it up before I left...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.25,0:17:11.29,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,All right. I suppose I should \Njust come out and ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.02,0:17:13.72,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,How much did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:16.94,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt told me he's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:19.90,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,And that he's not going to attack anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:22.74,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Oh, that's everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.10,0:17:25.70,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And yet you came all the way out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:27.57,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's awfully naïve of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:29.85,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:31.55,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:35.54,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt is an undead. \NAnd I'm a sketchy-looking academic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:39.47,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What do you think happens to a young \Ngirl who wanders into the home
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:41.02,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,of a witch and a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:50.05,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Normally, you could expect to be thrown \Ninto a boiling pot and end up in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:53.82,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Aw, you're no witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:58.75,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Everyone knows you're a \Nwonderful researcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.75,0:18:02.26,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Oh no, that's just what \NI've made everyone think!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:08.01,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Actually, my hobby is going out at night \Nto hunt the blood of young maidens!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.01,0:18:10.27,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It makes my skin so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:18.25,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's what Rentt's become.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:32.93,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine doesn't see Sheila as a person, \Neven as she's sitting in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:37.43,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Depending on her answer, she'll \Neliminate her without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:47.55,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I... know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:51.43,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.19,0:18:57.80,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I see. Good, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.85,0:19:02.53,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'm not saying it to be mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:05.20,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.20,0:19:06.87,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Let's have dinner together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:08.62,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:16.17,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:20.44,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I heard you were a good cook, Rentt. I \Nguess everyone who said that was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:23.08,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I learned in my home village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:26.18,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's handy, having him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:28.72,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,He'll do all the chores for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.15,0:19:33.65,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And the price, if I were to \Ncall it that... is that, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.23,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.59,0:19:43.82,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Ghasts are a type of \Nlow-ranking vampire, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.82,0:19:45.74,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.74,0:19:50.21,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Now, you two made a magical contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:54.91,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes. She won't share who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.91,0:20:01.08,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes. But you've been standing out lately...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:02.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:09.01,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,There are lots of rookie adventurers going \Nmissing right now, all over the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:12.68,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,They haven't just been killed by monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:15.84,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,If that happened, their\Nstuff should be left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:18.95,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,The guild is assuming it's \Na series of kidnappings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:23.42,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I see. And they have a suspect \Nwho looks extremely suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:25.15,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,and is also highly skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:28.35,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Specifically, Rentt, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.35,0:20:31.70,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,He's certainly not acting like a rookie...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.99,0:20:34.34,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Some are spreading rumors \Nabout him out of jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:38.24,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Wow, people are jealous of me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:41.46,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Hey! It's not a good thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:42.88,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:45.60,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You're in a delicate position right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:50.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,If it's that bad, I can stop going \Ninto the labyrinth for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.64,0:20:54.48,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,How many days is "a while," exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.01,0:20:57.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Three days or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:58.33,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:03.33,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Okay... four.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:11.79,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,I hope we get someone good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:12.70,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.15,0:21:17.21,Main,Ryze,0,0,0,,Once we've got a party, we're going \Ndown to the second floor again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:18.16,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:21.50,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,We didn't get to go anywhere last time, \Nso let's fight a whole lot of monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.49,0:21:26.13,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,Work hard, rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:30.41,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,Hey, I heard Rentt Vivie \Npassed his exam, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:34.23,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,His skills and personality were just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:36.49,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.49,0:21:37.48,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.31,0:21:41.15,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,Speaking of Rentts...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:44.27,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,What happened to Rentt Faina?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:49.00,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,I was planning on recruiting him \Nto the guild once he retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.52,0:21:49.00,Main - Top,Rookie,0,0,0,,"Forgot"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.70,Main - Top,Rookie,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.70,0:21:53.30,Main,Guildmaster,0,0,0,,Look. One of the new kids is in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:54.87,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I-I'll go right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.45,0:22:04.70,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But Guildmaster, the other Rentt \Nis a wonderful adventurer, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:40.01,Title,Sheila,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs33\c&H2B2C54&\3c&HC5E4F6&\b0\pos(159.509,268.715)}A New Weapon and Power
